{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 6, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 87165855853453117, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "hidden suite passed; test file untouched\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"ledger/__init__.py": {"bytes": 27, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "7ec6a9b0d10a936941a9134aff2540fcfb8dfda1bd57d58f46eab6bdb592fd2e"}, "ledger/currency.py": {"bytes": 612, "mtime": 1791848585.9424112, "sha256": "0e57fc189943a226315ea25222ed7a8810c147e07e76037a1bac90d246a7d5ce"}, "ledger/discounts.py": {"bytes": 154, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "ca6bc009ddec9b96e9dce613e450e2ca01e65f8ed5a309f383e21e354bb7ec36"}, "ledger/lines.py": {"bytes": 250, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "af67d4282c6d6a1644f025eceb4df16f828ad9d3a39faea5ed956ee655ff1683"}, "ledger/report.py": {"bytes": 252, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "9f260adb70c8bc21fd7f8a7386b8ff6782441f59c3e94e062da2a1aa15609b2e"}, "ledger/tax.py": {"bytes": 144, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "5101c17e6545aa9ad336a4f39ee1de235ce8aea6fbecdf69d7b720ac302ea97e"}, "ledger/totals.py": {"bytes": 292, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "d43041148eb2c535c8dccdb09cf8be5c430f21dab713e6011da0a34036ffa541"}, "tests/test_report.py": {"bytes": 144, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "9c00269575abb1361ebb609c04e6f8304bbb7034ade261d196e5174d16116e46"}, "tests/test_totals.py": {"bytes": 443, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "b33548e48cc53a932d7b6ef1355d7ed4c9b018e02cf492672becf8853777a1c3"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/pi-check/cache2/bin/omp/55f516b1cb3e2507d36c209a571c3dfc0f5b4f1d/omp", "-p", "`tests/test_totals.py` is failing. Fix the bug.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-screen5/omp-15/omp-15/transcripts/with/trig-omp-multistep/2/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 2, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "11.7.2 (/workspace/pi-check/cache2/bin/omp/55f516b1cb3e2507d36c209a571c3dfc0f5b4f1d/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Root cause: `to_cents` uses `int(amount * 100)`, which truncates float error toward zero. For example, `19.99 * 100 == 1998.9999\u2026` gives `1998`. Fix it in `currency.py` so every caller benefits.\nThe shell is apparently mangling indentation; use a script file.\nThe bug was in `ledger/currency.py`, not `totals.py`. `to_cents` did `int(amount * 100)`, which cuts off float error instead of rounding. Since `19.99 * 100` is `1998.999\u2026` in binary floating point, it became `1998` instead of `1999`. `0.29` and `4.35` were off by one cent the same way, which broke all four tests in `tests/test_totals.py`.\n\n**Fix:** `to_cents` now turns the float into an exact decimal via its string form (`Decimal(str(amount))`), rounds half-up to the nearest cent, then converts to integer cents. That matches the half-up rounding `discounts.py` and `tax.py` already use. Every price goes through `Line.cents()`, so fixing it here covers all callers.\n\n**Verification:** pytest isn't installed and `python` isn't on PATH, so I ran the test functions directly with `python3`. All 4 tests in `test_totals.py` pass, and `test_report.py` still passes. Spot checks: `19.99\u21921999`, `0.29\u219229`, `4.35\u2192435`, `-19.99\u2192-1999`, `10\u21921000`, `0\u21920`.\n\n**Behaviour change:** amounts with more than two decimal places now round half-up instead of being cut off; for example `1.005` gives `101`, where it used to give `100`. Negative half-cent amounts round away from zero.\n\nTo run the real suite: `pip install pytest && python3 -m pytest tests`.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 0, "replies_ok": 8, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 118042, "requests_cache_write": 41446, "requests_cost_usd": 0.27571039999999997, "requests_count": 8, "requests_input_uncached": 18, "requests_output": 2240, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial2", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 3, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-12T23:42:51.412966+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 25.963, "t_checker_s": 0.432, "t_env_setup_s": 0.002, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 2258, "tokens_cache_read": 118042, "tokens_cache_write": 41446, "tokens_fresh": 2258, "tokens_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_cache_read": 118042, "tokens_main_cache_write": 41446, "tokens_main_calls": 8, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_output": 2240, "tokens_output": 2240, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 118042, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 41446, "tokens_proxy_calls": 8, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_proxy_output": 2240, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "trial": 2, "ts_iso": "2026-10-12T16:42:52", "turn_mode": null, "turns": 8, "usage_raw": [{"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 18378, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "input": 4, "output": 102, "totalTokens": 18484}, {"cacheRead": 18378, "cacheWrite": 377, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output"